{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22286","headline":"南亭对酒送春 · 白居易","name":"南亭对酒送春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"含桃实已落，红薇花尚熏。\n冉冉三月尽，晚莺城上闻。\n独持一杯酒，南亭送残春。\n半酣忽长歌，歌中何所云。\n云我五十余，未是苦老人。\n刺史二千石，亦不爲贱贫。\n天下三品官，多老於我身。\n同年登第者，零落无一分。\n亲故半爲鬼，僮仆多见孙。\n念此聊自解，逢酒且欢欣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}